From 21687b1ad4f0cbb03d7e94668337276e2ea3228f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:42:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] mp.omwscripts is a built-in script list of its own, so a
 synced copy replaces it (scripts can be added, removed, changed)

- the engine loads every resources/vfs/*.omwscripts after builtin.omwscripts; the multiplayer mod's list ships as
  resources/vfs/mp.omwscripts instead of being merged into builtin.omwscripts (CMake, both packagers)
- a file of the same name in a client mod folder comes later in the data directories and replaces it
- the server hands out mp.omwscripts as a real file of the "multiplayer" mod (no empty stand-in list)
- README and unit test

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
